cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EdgeLens in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "EdgeLens: measure, diagnose and validate AI pipelines on edge devices"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ambigapathy
    given-names: Narmada
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Infinity-ops/edgelens"
keywords:
  - edge AI
  - NVIDIA Jetson
  - performance engineering
  - real-time
  - latency
  - energy efficiency
abstract: >-
  EdgeLens measures AI pipelines on edge devices stage by stage, reports tail
  latency, deadline misses, power and energy, records the hardware/software
  environment (including power mode and clock pinning) for reproducible
  comparisons, and gives evidence-based bottleneck diagnoses.
